WEBVTT

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:11.670
arashi no naka de kagayaite
You see the dream shining within the storm.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.960
sono yume o akiramenaide
Hang on to it now! Don't let it go.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:19.520
kizutsuita anata no senaka no
All I want is to take those wings on your back...

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.770
tenshi no hane sotto daite
Those wounded angel wings, and gently...

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.370
daite agetai
...pull them close to me.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:39.680
aoku hatenai sora no katasumi de
Newborn in a corner of the endless blue sky...

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.960
umareta yume ga
The dream is there,

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:46.090
ima chiisakutemo
and even though it may now be small...

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:50.960
koori tsuku you na
No matter how strong they may blow...

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:54.940
tsuyoi kaze de sae
...or how icy they may be...

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.710
sono mune ni kagayaku
...those winds can never erase...

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:03.140
yume o keshitari, sou yo
...the dream that shines. Oh, no!

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.650
keshitari nante dekinai
The dream that shines inside your heart!

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.880
arashi no naka de kagayaite
You see the dream shining within the storm.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:14.080
sono yume o akiramenaide
Hang on to it now! Don't let it go.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:17.680
kizutsuita anata no senaka no
All I want is to take those wings on your back...

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.920
tenshi no hane sotto daite
Those wounded angel wings, and gently...

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.300
daite agetai
...pull them close to me.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.660
I confirm two
Zanzibar-class ships!

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:37.390
Looks like they got
away from the Feddies.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.720
Dammit, we always
get left behind.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.990
Hey!

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:48.160
The resources they brought back
are the life line for Zeon.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:50.670
Well, I know, but...

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:54.640
The war isn't going to
end here with Odessa.

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:55.970
Enemy units, approaching!

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.640
Right! Leave 'em to me!

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:00.580
I'm gonna take you all
back to space, I swear!

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:01.840
Y- Yes, sir!

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:10.700
Two Feddie human-types.
Minovsky density rising!

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:15.290
Even using those humanoid ones to
search for defeated troops, huh?

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.730
Hey, get your head down!
You wanna go blind?!

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:21.270
Passing defense line one!
Beginning countdown!

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:23.270
All right! Fall back!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:28.080
Leave the heavy stuff!
Just take what you can carry!

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.410
Was that a?!

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:38.950
Just a vaporization bomb.
What else <i>would</i> it be?

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:42.490
176 seconds to shock wave!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.200
You're all right, sir.

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:56.140
Yeah.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.740
You're going to regroup at
Commodore Sahalin's base?

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:04.570
I'm sure he'll be
mad as hell about it.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:08.180
These idiots are actually trying
to take those things with them?

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:11.350
If everyone's ready, MOVE OUT!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.490
Let the Feddies have
Odessa and the Earth!

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:19.660
Let 'em cling to their
doomed little ball of dirt!

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.700
God dammit! Die already!

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.180
<i>Let go of me! Do you</i>
<i>want to get killed?!</i>

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:42.280
That voice... It can't be!

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.260
It can't!

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:55.060
Can Aina be the pilot
of this monster?

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.430
I've gotta make sure!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.940
Aina! Aina Sahalin!
Do you read me?!

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:04.070
Aina, I know it's you!
Answer me!

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:23.490
AINA!!!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.930
This is...
Anti-personnel weaponry.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:13.700
<i>Is the pilot not using it</i>
<i>because it's Aina in there?</i>

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:20.440
<i>Or is it because</i>
<i>they're dead?</i>

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.980
Aina!
Aina Sahalin, right?!

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:03.350
Don't you remember?!
It's me, Shiro Amada!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:07.330
If you're alive,
then answer me!

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:24.310
It really is!
It really is Shiro Amada!

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.540
So, you remember me.
I'm glad you're okay.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:31.180
I didn't think I'd
ever see you again.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.690
Same here.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.860
He was actually
worried about me...

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:45.340
Found 'em!
I've got them!

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.170
Really?!

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.330
Please don't look.
This is secret.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.570
Please, use these.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.640
I'm saved! I can get my suit
running again with these.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.400
I hope these
parts fit yours.

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.110
These aren't
secret, are they?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:03.420
Don't worry. You can
get them anywhere.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.850
Well, then, thanks.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:12.390
We may have been fighting
each other up till now...

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:15.090
...but unless we work together,
we're not going to survive.

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:22.140
All right! It works!

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:25.370
A Zeon and a Feddie,
helping each other.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.780
Things get very strange when
you're around, Ensign Shiro Amada.

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:30.210
<i>Don't most people</i>
<i>act this way?</i>

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:33.050
But... Never mind.
Here I go!

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.550
<i>Let 'er rip!</i>

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:58.140
I can't maintain equilibrium!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.290
<i>Shiro, do you read me?!</i>

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:16.690
<i>At this rate, we're both</i>
<i>going to die! Please!</i>

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:21.230
No! Live or die,
we're doing it together!

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.100
You are so!

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:30.630
Besides... There's still hope!

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:33.240
C'MON!!!

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:47.790
49... 48... 47... 46...
Do I have enough propellant?!

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.830
Not yet!

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.320
That's enough! Save yourself!

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.460
<i>Not yet!</i>

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.120
<i>It's hopeless!</i>

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:34.130
Aina! I love you!

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.290
Are we all right?

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:05.200
Shiro Amada, I...

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.380
SHIRO!!!!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.630
Low pressure front moving in
from the north-east.

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:33.990
Weather conditions worsening.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.590
We've picked up what appears
to be a Feddie distress signal.

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.140
Verify its coordinates
and dispatch a Luggun.

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:42.130
We just lost that
distress signal!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.370
What?!

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:46.030
We should have an approximate
fix on those coordinates.

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:49.200
There's no problem.
We'll get her back.

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:50.180
Sir!

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.170
Where are you going?

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.980
There's no need for me to
direct things with you here.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:57.040
But, Miss Aina is!

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:59.850
That was a Feddie
distress signal.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.290
Which means my
Apsalus beat it.

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:22.370
Aina...

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:26.440
<i>Is Aina all right?</i>

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.220
AINA!!!

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:56.540
<i>Miss Aina! Please respond!</i>

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.510
<i>We picked up a
Feddie distress signal!</i>

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:02.680
<i>Miss Aina, please respond!</i>

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:06.020
<i>It's only a matter of time before</i>
<i>enemy search parties get to you!</i>

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.790
<i>Miss Aina, please respond!</i>

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:11.420
<i>Forgive me, Norris.</i>
<i>This time I have to help him.</i>

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.340
<i>God dammit!</i>

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:32.080
<i>I have to find some</i>
<i>shelter from this wind!</i>

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.280
<i>Water? But why?</i>

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:48.660
It's still hot from when
I maxed the engines before.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.490
<i>Captain Norris, we can't</i>
<i>take more of this!</i>

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.300
Wait for the weather
to improve.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.070
<i>Miss Aina, I hope</i>
<i>you're all right!</i>

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:17.760
It's no use...

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.460
<i>I'm so tired...</i>

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.360
Gas!

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:14.920
ZEON!!!

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:26.460
Shiro?

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:28.470
Shiro!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:35.330
Your hands are frostbitten.
I wouldn't try using them.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:40.500
I wish we could heat up some
water and warm them up slowly.

00:14:41.550 --> 00:14:43.450
I'm sorry. I...

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.050
Shiro?

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.520
Please come inside
the snow cave.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:58.350
Don't worry about
what happened before!

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:02.760
I... I hate the Zeon!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:08.240
But ever since that
day we met in space...

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.310
...I haven't been able
to forget about you.

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:14.740
Even though you're Zeon.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.940
Even though you've
got a boyfriend.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:18.350
A boyfriend?

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.760
I don't have a boyfriend.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:32.520
And even though you're
a Feddie, my answer is...

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:40.240
Aina...

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:52.210
Enter.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:56.250
We're going to try
recovering Miss Aina again.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.720
If you'll excuse me.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.270
Your brother?!

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:15.030
So, THAT'S who he is.

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:18.340
Yes. And my
brother is wrong.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.010
Aina!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.550
My brother is wrong.

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:38.160
There's something
I need help with.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:42.290
This is a new
Feddie weapon, right?

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:43.660
Are you sure about this?

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:46.790
Well, it's okay as long as you forget
the secret stuff after you're done.

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.970
I can't do any delicate work
with my hands the way they are.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.100
Right?

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:55.150
So, you trust a Zeon that much?

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.140
I do.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.250
For now at least, let's just
forget about the war...

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.620
...Zeon, the Federation,
and your brother.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:10.360
All right.
Let's forget about them.

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:22.070
All right!
All right! Stop!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.250
Okay, do it!

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:51.930
Whew! Even at the lowest setting,
this thing really packs a wallop!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.700
Using a beam weapon
to heat the water...

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:02.370
You really get
some strange ideas!

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.260
My hands are all
pins and needles.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:17.760
Hang in there. That means your
blood is starting to flow again.

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.020
My feet are going numb.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.560
Say, you want in
on the bath here?

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:28.430
The Luggun's slower,
so send it out first!

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:29.730
Hurry up on
refueling the Dopp!

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.030
Captain Norris!

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:36.150
Odessa has...
It's fallen, sir.

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:41.220
Recover our soldiers
on the northern line.

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:43.120
Tighten security
around the base.

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.120
Sir!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.380
The map of power on Earth
is redrawn yet again...

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:01.200
You can look now.

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:05.970
My heart is beating so fast!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.370
So is mine.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:14.080
You're pretty, Aina.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.250
Like a living doll.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.820
Big Brother!

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:32.970
Aina, become my arms.
Become my legs...

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.940
Aina? Aina... Aina!

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:39.600
Shiro!

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:45.180
I'm!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.050
I'm not just a doll for
Ginias to play with!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.350
I come this far and NOW
run into the Feddies?!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:21.780
I wish we could just be the
last man and woman in the world...

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.320
Some day... We'll meet again.

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:45.470
Why?

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.510
There's no reason to fight!

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.850
<i>Have sighted enemy prototype!</i>

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:01.590
This is the war
we're fighting...

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:08.560
STOP IT!!!

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:12.790
Are you trying
to kill yourself?!

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.830
Aina, tell me!

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:20.430
If this is war, is there
no hope at all for US?!

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:52.470
Hurry up and
rescue Miss Aina!

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:53.910
The Feddies still have
another plane in the area!

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:28.570
What about the
Feddie pilot?

00:22:29.480 --> 00:22:30.850
Eliminated.

00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:54.400
osanaikoro kara
All that time that's passed me by.

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:58.090
sou kyou made no so many days
From childhood till now, so many days.

00:22:58.170 --> 00:23:02.230
furikaereba ironna
When I look back, I see so many things...

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:06.000
koto ni meguriatta
...that happened to come into my life.

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:09.170
naitari warattari
The times I cried, the times I laughed.

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:13.180
kenka shitari yume mitari
The times I fought, the times I dreamed.

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:17.310
chotto hard na shitsuren mo
The lost loves that were sort of hard.

00:23:17.390 --> 00:23:20.450
kagayaku my history
All shining in my history.

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:23.590
ikutsumono
The ones who caused me pain...

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:28.460
deai to wakare kugurinukete
...I met and left along the way.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:34.330
ai suru anata ni sou yo
But I still ended up meeting you.

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:38.670
Love! meguriaeta
The one that I love.

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:43.570
Ten years after juunen go no
Ten years after, A decade from now.

00:23:43.680 --> 00:23:47.340
watashi wa doushiteru darou
I wonder what I will be doing then.

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:54.480
donna fuu ni anata o sukideiru darou
I wonder how I will be still loving you.

00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:58.590
Ten years after, juunen go no
Ten years after, a decade from now.

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:02.660
anata o mitsumete mitai
I still want to be looking at you.

00:24:02.730 --> 00:24:06.400
Stay together sono toki
Stay together. When that day comes...

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:13.090
kitto soba de hohoendeitai
...I want to be at your side with a smile.

00:24:15.230 --> 00:24:18.600
Was the Aina I saw in the
blizzard just an illusion?

00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:20.860
After I get back home alive...

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:22.900
...I find a tough military
tribunal waiting for me.

00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:24.500
And while that's going on...

00:24:24.570 --> 00:24:25.800
...Kiki's village is
attacked by the enemy!

00:24:25.870 --> 00:24:27.570
But while I'm under
suspicion of being a spy...

00:24:27.640 --> 00:24:29.270
...I've been placed
under house arrest!

00:24:29.380 --> 00:24:31.240
Why won't the Federal
Forces do something?!

00:24:31.510 --> 00:24:32.840
If I don't save them...

00:24:32.910 --> 00:24:34.900
They may be guerrillas,
but they're also my friends!

00:24:35.240 --> 00:24:39.200
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam -
The 08th MS Team:

00:24:39.650 --> 00:24:41.480
"Duty and Ideals."
